<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT--3Com EPS estimates cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT--3Com EPS estimates cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hambrecht &amp; Quist cut its fourth quarter earnings estimates for 3Com Corp to $0.46 a share from $0.48 a share and its fiscal year 1997 estimates to $2.03 a share from $2.05 a share.</p>
<p>--cut fiscal 1998 earnings to $2.39 from $2.49.</p>
<p>--said the move was in response to anticipated price cuts in a competitive environment.</p>
<p>--shares of 3Com were 1-1/16 lower at 27-9/16 in afternoon trading on Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
